00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:45.020
Huh?

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.040
What's wrong with all of you?

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:54.550
I told you to try them on.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.560
Excuse me, Sudo-san...

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.470
What is it, Matsuda-chan?

00:01:58.470 --> 00:01:59.700
Aren't these great?

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.560
Nothing beats white swimsuits.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:03.960
Well...

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.520
Don't they look nice?

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:08.140
It's standard for idols these days.

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:10.960
Standard? Those swimsuits?

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.760
Of course they are.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:15.320
You need to put yourself 
out there to make it big.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.950
You showed off your panties 
at your end-of-the-year concert.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.210
That wasn't...

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.960
It was great!

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.950
It was amazing!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.960
It was passionate!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.210
Here! Now try these on.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.830
You're still not done changing?

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.040
U-Um...

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:36.960
Not yet.

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:40.720
Sudo-san said he wanted 
to check before the job.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.350
Do you think you could hurry up?

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.480
What job?

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:51.930
Sudo-san has found 
a stage for you already.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:52.480
What?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.340
Ow!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.230
A stage?

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:58.490
<b>Bath</b>

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.490
Is this the stage?!

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:03.160
<b>The <i>Wake Up, Girls! </i>movie, <i>Seven Idols,</i> now in theaters!</b>

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:07.700
<b>Watch the movie to find out how the group was formed and enjoy the TV series even more!</b>

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:13.580
<b>For more information, check out the website!</b>

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:15.330
Um, are they supposed to sing here?

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.710
Of course.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:20.510
Sudo-san!

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.340
I've been waiting for you.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.510
Oh, this must be Worked Up Girl.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.260
We're Wake Up, Girls!

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.130
Oh, sorry.

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:31.250
This is the manager 
who invited you here today.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.770
Come on. Say hello.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.960
We're Wake Up, Girls!

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.750
Thank you for having us!

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:42.280
This is my first time 
seeing idols in person.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:44.690
Thank you for having us today.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:45.880
Thank you!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.350
Let's get started, then.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:50.370
Why are we wearing swimsuits?

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.620
Probably because they're skimpy.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.420
No way!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.730
Why do we have to sing like this?

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:59.130
I'm so distracted, 
I don't think I can sing.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:05.390
I don't think it's unreasonable 
to wear swimsuits at a health spa...

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:09.890
I'm glad we have work, 
but singing here?

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:14.820
I didn't think we'd get 
to stand on a stage so soon, though.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.520
You're right, but...

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.730
We accepted the job. Let's do it.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.530
What? You're doing what 
that Sudo man wants?

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.690
No.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:29.680
I don't know what he meant by 
"putting ourselves out there,"

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.290
but I think he's right.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.290
Huh.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.430
You're right.

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.780
We just have to do our best.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.750
All right! Let's go!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:42.970
Ow!

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.480
Uh...

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.440
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:06.550
Allow me to introduce today's guest.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:07.680
We've been waiting!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:08.240
Yeah!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.670
Um, this is Working Girl.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.430
We're Wake Up, Girls!

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.380
Oh, I got it wrong again.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.310
Sorry.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.350
Hey, working girls!

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:26.850
Um, Wake Up, Girls! is apparently 
a Sendai-based idol group.

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:27.730
Who cares?

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:28.800
Yeah!

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.590
On Christmas last year,

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.270
they performed their debut 
concert in Kotodai Park.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.810
Nice ass, girls!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.150
Today, they will sing 
their debut song for us.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:41.180
Forget the song!

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:42.720
Give us something extra!

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:46.340
Um, the name of the song is...

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.480
Uh, um...

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.420
It's "Stand Up!"

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:59.030
We only have one song,
but we'll sing our hearts out.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:00.260
Please listen.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:02.380
Give them a hand!

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:05.380
St-Stand Up?

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.400
This doesn't feel right...

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:38.730
<i>Believing...</i>

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.670
Thank you very much!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.880
That was hot!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.680
Take the rest off!

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.400
Man, hot girls are great!

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:50.430
Can't you do something about it?

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.550
About what?

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:55.180
Well, you know...

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:56.770
Their outfits...

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:57.930
What?

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.440
You think you're in any 
position to complain?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.970
Learn your place.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:05.190
You're a bunch of nameless 
country idol wannabes.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.860
Look.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:15.120
Even the super popular I-1 Club's 
Iwazaki Shiho's doing it.

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.080
But gravure photo shoots and today's stage aren't...

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:18.900
They are the same.

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:19.640
What?

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.830
They both take resolve.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.290
I see.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.730
Without resolve, 
you'll never make it big.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:28.380
Yes, well... but...

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:32.630
Anyway... They'll never make it 
with you as their manager.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:33.510
What?

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:39.220
A manager's job is 
putting his idols onstage.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:44.530
Whether or not they'll take that 
one opportunity is up to the girls.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.910
Turning one into five into ten 
won't happen for a while.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.280
Right...

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:54.580
You don't even try to put them 
on the stage of opportunity.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:57.740
In fact, are you trying 
to take them off it?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.290
No.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.080
Then quit complaining.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.000
Okay.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.890
He completely lost that argument.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.300
You're quite stiff.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:15.240
Really? Must be troubles of life.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:19.060
Just thinking about returning...

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:19.790
Huh?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.060
Nothing.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.560
In any case, let's complete 
your remaining performances.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.210
We're the ones who have to put on

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.820
those embarrassing 
performances, not you.

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.280
Yeah, but...

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:39.570
I think there's something 
fishy about that Sudo man.

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:40.830
I agree.

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:45.710
How much are we getting paid?

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:48.340
I left that up to Sudo-san.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.760
Did you sign a contract?

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.800
A contract...

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:59.780
Outfits must be highly 
exposing swimsuits...

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.060
A swimsuit photo shoot?

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.830
Take some bolder poses!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.420
Like a panther!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.240
Pose like a panther!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.330
A panther?

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:29.540
Like this? Meow.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:32.900
Not quite...

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.590
But whatever... It's cute!

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:38.280
This isn't right.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:41.470
This isn't what we should 
be doing for our fans.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:46.020
Waiting on customers?

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.020
Here you are.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.040
One beer.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.530
I'd like some beer, too.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.530
Why don't you sit with us?

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:05.750
Your tits and ass are huge, girl.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.150
No.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.750
This isn't right.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:15.050
Participating in various attractions...

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.010
Attractions?

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.610
They'll be playing games 
with the customers.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.010
People love it.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.040
Let's get the games started!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.390
Yeah!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.700
We've been waiting for this!

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.520
Who wants to play the King's Game?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:44.280
Number 2, you get a kiss from Miyu-chan!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.790
Yeah!

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:49.040
Please come forward.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:49.820
Okay.

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:53.580
Please excuse me.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:11:18.360
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.970
This can't be right.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.050
Miyu?

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.620
Yeah!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.570
No!

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:30.070
Miyu!

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:43.340
Is that...

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:48.870
I'd rather quit than do this!

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:53.940
I get it!

00:11:55.380 --> 00:12:01.150
I'm terribly sorry, but would it 
be possible to cancel this job?

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:01.780
What?!

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:04.660
But so many customers 
are here to see them...

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:08.580
I know, but I don't think 
it's good for the girls.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.170
You'll have to return the money.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.110
Return?

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:13.960
I paid Sudo-san beforehand.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.160
They're great, though.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.170
The Woof and Meow Girls.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.510
Are you doing that on purpose?

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.360
I knew it.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:25.260
Excuse me.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.490
Miyu.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.690
What about the last performance?

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:33.310
What?

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.800
We have to do it, don't we?

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:40.070
I think I could handle one more.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.530
I don't want to do it.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.250
I'm not performing anymore.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.320
The people who want to can do it.

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:49.450
What do you mean, 
the people who want to?

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:52.500
You seemed pretty into it, Kaya.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.460
How?

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.940
Stop.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.230
It's a job.

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.960
We can't say we don't want to do it.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:00.960
Huh?

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:05.930
Hey, wait!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.050
What?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.600
Are you stupid?!

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.930
President Tange!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.050
What are you doing, Matsuda?

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:14.870
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:17.010
Wait, you!

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.030
How dare you call me stupid?!

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:21.110
We'll talk about that later!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.940
First, I have to deal 
with this trash!

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:27.240
I'm not sure you can 
call anyone trash...

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.650
Sudo-san, was it?

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.940
You're that thug producer 
I've heard about!

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:35.620
How dare you take advantage 
of stupid Matsuda's kindness?!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.310
Listen up!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:38.050
While I'm alive,

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:40.010
don't even think about 
approaching Matsuda or

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:41.560
Wake Up, Girls! again!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.300
If you break that promise 
and try to lure them in again...

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.250
I'll pay you back double!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.720
I'll give you a watery grave!

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:53.920
Also, I'm sure you haven't spent 
much of your earnings yet.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.650
You'll be paying them back 
for the canceled show.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:57.580
Got it?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.750
If you understand, say so!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.480
I-I understand!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.580
Get out of here!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.610
Green Leaves Entertainment

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.610
What have you been doing until now?

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:14.360
Searching for myself, I guess.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:15.870
Don't be ridiculous!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.540
I can't believe you ran off 
with the agency's money!

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.000
We couldn't perform 
our debut concert,

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.630
and the agency's future 
was in jeopardy!

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:27.530
So you were deceived 
by a thug producer.

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:32.640
You haven't uttered 
a word of apology yet.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:33.640
What?

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.430
She's right.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.790
Well, um...

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:41.560
We decided to continue 
working with Matsuda-san,

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:45.450
and he did his best 
to get the job, and...

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:49.910
This is how it turned out, 
but you know how Matsuda-san is.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:52.580
Huh?

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:53.670
Don't worry about it.

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.700
President, what happened to the money?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:02.130
My darling needed money, 
so I thought I'd make some.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.640
I gambled it, and now it's gone.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.090
Man, I'm beat.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.840
I'm really sorry.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.030
What?

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:10.090
You're an adult! 
Take responsibility for your actions!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.430
I know. I don't need an 
angry little girl to tell me.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.970
Little girl?

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.440
Who do you think I am?

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.040
Huh?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.350
One of you is missing.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:23.260
What?

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:28.810
I can't believe you lost one already.

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:31.230
I went to the trouble 
of gathering seven of you.

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:32.860
Why are you just standing there?

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:35.020
Bring her back!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.120
Um...

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.750
Go on!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:44.020
I wonder where Miyu went.

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.170
Probably home.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.170
She's not answering her phone.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:48.870
Maybe...

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:51.130
Could she be there?

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:55.470
You know I work 
at a maid café, right?

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.720
I'll check it out.

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.730
I'll go with you.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:00.600
Okay.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.890
Let's split up.

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:04.480
We'll check her home.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:06.360
You'll check her job.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.610
<b>Maid in Sendai</b>

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.590
<b>Maid in Sendai</b>

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:13.190
It's so cute in here.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:14.610
It's so like Miyu.

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:19.120
Welcome back, Mistress.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:32.810
I'm starting to think this store 
is the right level for me.

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:36.920
What? Didn't you say 
you had no doubts?

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:41.890
I did say that, 
but like Sudo-san said,

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.520
maybe I lacked resolve.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.270
What do you mean?

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:53.780
<b>Maid in Sendai</b>

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:53.780
I sang and danced every day 
on the little stage in this store.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:58.760
I feel so comfortable 
around the customers here.

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:06.000
Anyway, being surrounded by 
those fans made me want more.

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:12.320
If only I could stand on a larger 
stage and have even more fans...

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:15.470
But I realized something 
after yesterday's performance.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.600
I was naïve.

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.510
About what?

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:23.610
Ultimately, what I enjoyed was being

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:28.020
coddled by the fans 
of this familiar store.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:30.570
Besides, they would never

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:34.400
force me to do anything 
I didn't want to do.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:41.030
Becoming an idol means interacting

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:45.790
with complete strangers and 
overcoming the unimaginable.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:49.310
It feels like a blow to the head.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.710
It's time for my show.

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:56.080
Um, President Tange came back and...

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.620
President Tange came back?

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:01.440
She's not going to 
trick us again, is she?

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:03.720
I don't think she will this time.

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:06.480
Miyu, you'll come back, won't you?

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:11.940
Will you watch me perform?

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:20.260
Miyu has returned to participate 
in today's performance!

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:23.670
Miyu!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:27.280
I'm home, everyone!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:28.730
We missed you!

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:29.500
Welcome home!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.300
How has everyone been?

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:33.300
We're great!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.990
She's so popular.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:34.260
We missed you!

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:34.760
Yeah.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:36.120
We were lonely!

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:38.330
Let's get started!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.510
"Burn Chaos, According to the Sun."

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:43.600
<i>We! (Ooh!) Are gonna break! (Nya!)</i>

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:44.970
<i>The world is Dark! (Cosmic!)</i>

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:50.380
<i>Ooh! Nya! Ooh! Nya! Ooh! Nya!</i>

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.020
<i>Let's Nya!</i>

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.310
<i>Pagan gods with slimy hearts</i>

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.310
Miyu's amazing.

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:57.710
She seems like a professional.

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:58.670
<i>You and I are both cowardly and curious</i>

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.110
She's so friendly with her fans.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:01.950
<i>If the crawly pagan runs away</i>

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:05.370
<i>You and I can enjoy a date 
under the burning sun</i>

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:10.260
<i>Isn't this fun? We'll burn and we'll melt</i>

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:12.540
<i>We're not alive!</i>

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:14.700
That was great!

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.250
You're the best!

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:20.770
That was so fun!

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:23.850
Maid in Sendai is the best!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.850
What about Wake Up, Girls!?

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:31.170
I haven't decided yet.

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.700
What?

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:34.690
It's harder than I thought.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.950
As you all know, 
I'm not very good at anything.

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:39.110
You can do it!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.460
I'm excited to see what you 
can do with Wake Up, Girls!

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.950
Leave this place and make it big!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.920
We'll support you even more!

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:47.370
What?

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:51.500
I saw your Christmas 
concert in Kotodai Park!

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:52.830
Really?

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:56.150
I just happened to be in the area, 
but it was great!

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:58.630
Wake Up, Girls! will make it big!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:01.510
Your work inspires us!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:02.820
Yeah!

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.820
We're here for you!

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:06.510
You can do it!

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:09.240
Miyu, what's wrong?

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.110
Are you okay?

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:11.100
Um, I...

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:14.260
I'm not good at anything...

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:15.860
That's not true!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:21.840
I always run from 
anything I don't like.

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:27.680
The fans here are always 
so nice and supportive.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:32.870
But today, after seeing 
everyone again, I realized something.

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:35.560
It's my turn.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.560
That's right! You can do it!

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:38.370
Yeah!

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:39.630
Miyu!

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.520
In order to inspire you,

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:46.640
I'll work up the courage 
to participate in Wake Up, Girls!

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.260
I hope you'll continue to support me.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:56.910
That's great.

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:57.670
Yeah.

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.720
They really love Miyu.

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:02.170
I didn't know fans could be so nice.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.820
They're all so warm.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:05.780
Huh?

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.280
Nothing.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:11.660
Girls, you have a new job!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.500
Proposal 
Local News Program

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.500
<b>"It's 4 o'clock!"</b>

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.400
Sendai Television...

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:18.520
Local news program <i>It's 4 o'clock!</i>

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.210
You'll be regulars on the show!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.510
Just as part of a small segment, though.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:24.520
What?

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:27.670
What?! That's amazing!

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.710
What? We're going to be on TV?

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:30.510
That's amazing!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.060
Regulars?

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:33.730
President, just who are you?

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.110
That's crazy!

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:36.270
I told you I'd take responsibility.

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:38.320
You don't have any complaints, do you?

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:39.770
No.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:41.810
You know what they say about me!

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:43.400
"A sea squirt is a sea squirt!"

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.150
Don't you mean "caviar is 
caviar, even if it's off"?

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.480
It doesn't matter!

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:47.660
It does.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.530
Let's give it everything 
we have, Wake Up, Girls!

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:06.670
I will now announce 
the members participating

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:08.300
in the opening performance 
of the Sendai Theater.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:14.970
To be continued

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:47.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:47.180
Minami, you eat so much.

00:23:47.180 --> 00:23:47.840
You think so?

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:48.910
Why don't you gain weight?

00:23:48.910 --> 00:23:49.680
Maybe it's just how I am.

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:51.340
I have a lot in the morning.

00:23:51.340 --> 00:23:53.820
I'm not asking about that!

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:55.520
What? I have a lot of energy.

00:23:55.520 --> 00:23:56.850
Oh, that's what you meant?

00:23:56.850 --> 00:23:58.900
The next episode is 
"Kindest!"

00:23:57.010 --> 00:24:00.040
<b>"Kindest"</b>

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:02.040
<b></b>

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:04.040
<b></b>
